# The language-neutral semantic IR schema lever (#11570).
#
# Add one `<issue>-<slug>` line when a change extends or reinterprets the
# semantic IR vocabulary. It is hashed into `SemanticIrVersion::current()`, so
# every semantic artifact key, every public id derived from one, every stored
# lowered-IR producer epoch, the policy lowering identity and the
# correspondence analyzer-schema pin of every language rotate once. Git merges
# this file with merge=union, so two branches that each add a line keep both.
# Never edit or remove a line; compaction replaces a prefix with a checkpoint
# line and keeps the identity. See .agents/docs/cache-identity-levers.md.
#
# Replaced the numbered literal `SEMANTIC_IR_SCHEMA_VERSION = 50`.
11570-slice2a-token-files
11360-m2-cleanup-owner-gaps
11251-matches-intrinsic
4318-address-of-flow
4318-pointer-memory-load-flow
12128-rust-async-body-execution
9925-poem-field-binders
